OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1787084321
OL,3,CSouth Armagh campaign moves to rename
OL,4,Clocal authority
OL,6,FResidents of south Armagh have said
OL,7,Fthey want the words 'South Armagh' to
OL,8,Fbe added to the name of the local
OL,9,Fauthority 'Newry, Mourne and Down'
OL,10,Fbecause they say "they feel left out".
OL,12,FNicknamed 'Bandit Country' by some
OL,13,Fduring the Troubles, the community is
OL,14,Feager to move past that historical
OL,15,Fstigma and focus on its real identity.
OL,17,FSinn Fein Councillor Martin Hearty is
OL,18,Fspearheading the campaign for the name
OL,19,Fchange.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
