CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1787084321
OL,3,CSouth Armagh campaign moves to rename
OL,4,Clocal authority
OL,6,FCllr Hearty said: "This isn't just an
OL,7,Fissue of symbolism.
OL,9,F"There are very real issues around
OL,10,Fbrand recognition, name recognition,
OL,11,Fand visibility when it comes to
OL,12,Fpromoting an area, when it comes to
OL,13,Fattracting investment, when it comes
OL,14,Fto attracting tourism into an area.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
