PN,41103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1787084321
OL,3,CSouth Armagh campaign moves to rename
OL,4,Clocal authority
OL,6,F"We have so much to offer here. We
OL,7,Fhave areas of outstanding natural
OL,8,Fbeauty, we have one of the best
OL,9,Fexamples of a ring dyke in Europe, we
OL,10,Fhave wonderfully preserved Neolithic
OL,11,Fhistorical sites here, sites that are
OL,12,F6, 7, 8,000 years old."
OL,14,FStaff in neighbouring districts say
OL,15,Fthey often find themselves taking
OL,16,Fcalls from visitors looking for south
OL,17,FArmagh landmarks, simply because the
OL,18,Fcouncil name offers no clear direction.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
