OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1787084321
OL,3,CSouth Armagh campaign moves to rename
OL,4,Clocal authority
OL,6,FAdd to that the logistical isolation
OL,7,Fwith council meetings often held an
OL,8,Fhour away in Downpatrick and many in
OL,9,Fthe community feel a clear disconnect
OL,10,Ffrom the heart of local decision-
OL,11,Fmaking.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
