CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1787084321
OL,3,CSouth Armagh campaign moves to rename
OL,4,Clocal authority
OL,6,FOne local resident said: "It's going
OL,7,Fto be difficult to make everybody feel
OL,8,Finclusive without somebody going, 'Oh,
OL,9,Fwell, why aren't we counted?' You
OL,10,Fknow, so while it's nice to be
OL,11,Fincluded, I get where it might be
OL,12,Fdifficult to incorporate the name in
OL,13,Fthe name, incorporate South Armagh in
OL,14,Fthe name of the council, but it would
OL,15,Fbe nice to be recognised."
OL,17,FAnother resident said: "I think it's a
OL,18,Fgood idea. After all, South Armagh has
OL,19,Fa lot of history, and for tourists,
OL,20,Fand I think it should be recognised."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
